Package: oosync
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: DIRTY FLUSHER
 Flushes cached filesystem data from page cache buffers to non-volatile disks.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
